          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï ECHOTYON Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwochinö pipö Israel lö, chi anka tïkwïl nyo tötoy ropöwo pöghisyö ompö ECHOTYON, kutötoy kareran kïlïkwï ropöwontenyi ompö ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipuno ewunechi ropöwonto omisyö nyo kitöni ECHOTYON. Ipu sunetkö nko take atökewiswis ompö ECHOTYON le ropöwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïpel tïsin sunetkö ompö ato kïpelo amöros, wölo pöyitu take tïsï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otöninekwa tïsin ropöwonte nyo roptoy kisönkö nko sunetkö kïpes pö okumpö tagh nyo pö ropöwonto pöghisyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.32+LEV.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.32",
              "LEV.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kachengan take nko chatït ompö ropöwo tuyo kalya cho ipu pipö Israel atönön tïsï le karerantangwa nyo ngwïno pipö Israel kokay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyete kï kareranpa ropöw cho kïropchini ECHOTYON, cho kikïngotyï Aron nko werkachi asisini kikïkïl le tïsï cho pöghisyechini ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwochï ECHOTYON pipö Israel kutötö nyete kïlïkwï nyingwa kokay asisini kikïkïl chane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
